<title>USA: FOB Gulf Grain - Corn and wheat mostly steady.</title>
<headline>FOB Gulf Grain - Corn and wheat mostly steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>FOB Gulf corn basis values were mostly steady on Wednesday while soybean positions were steady to higher.</p>
<p>The market was quiet, a dealer said, referring to sluggish exports and some corn harvest pressure in the Midwest.</p>
<p>In export news, Taiwan's Hui Shung Group will tender on Thursday for 38,000 tonnes of U.S. soybeans and 16,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 corn, traders said. The tender specifies delivery in one shipment for November 10-25 and/or November 26-December 9.  </p>
